{!Lead.NTE_Event_Code__c} · Internal notification

New partner / sponsor application.

{!Lead.Company} has applied to participate at {!Lead.NTE_Event_Code__c}.

Hello NTE team,

A new partner / sponsor application is ready for review.

Organisation and contact
Organisation {!Lead.Company}
